:: Good_Morning_Mr._Holland [simulation activity] {"position":"1800,450","size":"100,100"}
<<silently>>
<<audio "alarm" volume 0.5 play>>
<</silently>>\
<h1>Good Morning</h1>\
<hr>\
<<if State.variables.myRole == "patient">>\
Your alarm wakes you and it's time to get up. You get the strangest feeling that this was the same song you woke up to yesterday morning...

Before you spend too much time thinking about the radio playlist you remember you've got a lot of things to do today. You hope that you will be able to get it all done.
<hr>\
@@.holland;Mr. Holland@@ it's time to start the day. Go ahead and get out of bed now.
    
Once you are fully standing and ready to start your day, click below to head to the bathroom to get cleaned up.

//Note that you will not be able to progress until your @@.observer;Observer@@ has evaluated your actions at this station//
<hr>
    <<patient-next "Head to the Bathroom (Shower)" "Showering">>\
<<else>>\
@@.holland;Mr. Holland's@@ alarm goes off, it's time for him to wake up. As he listens to the song playing over the radio he gets the strangest feeling of deja-vu...
<hr>\
Tell @@.holland;Mr. Holland@@ to physically get out of bed. Observe their actions carefully as they do this.
    
Once he is fully standing, click the appropriate evaluation below.
<hr>
<<dynamic-eval "Activity: Getting Out of Bed"
  "He sat and rested on the edge before standing | -1 | 1 | satAndRested | green"
  "He got straight out of bed without resting | -2 | 1 | rushed | red"
>>\
<</if>>

<!--[[Showering]]-->


